abstract: "Two mathematical results in distinct intrinsic quantum randomness models: exact fixed-state Rényi optimum attainment by an explicit state-weighted MIC in every finite dimension; and a rigorous negative answer to Curran’s higher-dimensional SIC minimax question already in dimension three."
